---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = 'September 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — Healthgarden"
  description="How Healthgarden handles information submitted through this website."
>
  <section class="px-6 pt-10 pb-8 text-center md:pt-14">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide-label text-sage">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl italic leading-tight text-teal-deep md:text-4xl">
      How your information<br />is handled
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-sage">Last updated {updated}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-border-soft px-6 py-12">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">

      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-body md:text-base">
        This page explains what happens to the information you share through this website. It is written plainly and kept short on purpose.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-sm uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-sage">What the contact form collects</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-body md:text-base">
        When you send a message through the contact form, I receive your name, your email address, the nature of your inquiry, and anything you write in the message field. Your phone number is optional.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-body md:text-base">
        That information is sent to me by email so I can respond. It is not stored in a database on this website, and this website has no account or login.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-sm uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-sage">Please keep medical details out of the form</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-body md:text-base">
        The contact form is ordinary email, not a secure clinical channel. Please use it to tell me that you would like to talk — not to describe a diagnosis, test results, medications, or anything else about your health.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-body md:text-base">
        Anything clinical happens after we connect, through a scheduled consultation or through my secure client portal, which is built for health information. If you have already sent something sensitive through the form, tell me and I will remove it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-sm uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-sage">How long I keep it</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-body md:text-base">
        Inquiries stay in my email while we are in contact and for a reasonable period afterward in case you get back in touch. If you would like your inquiry deleted, ask and I will delete it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-sm uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-sage">Who else sees it</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-body md:text-base">
        No one. I do not sell, rent, or share inquiry information, and I do not send marketing email. The only third parties involved are the ordinary services that carry and store the message — the web host that delivers this site, the email service that sends the notification, and my email provider.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-sm uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-sage">Website analytics</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-body md:text-base">
        This site uses Google Analytics to count visits and see which pages people read. It records things like the pages you view, roughly where in the world you are, and what kind of device you used. It does not tell me who you are, and it is not connected to anything you send through the contact form.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-body md:text-base">
        Google Analytics sets cookies in your browser to do this. You can block them through your browser settings or by using Google's opt-out browser add-on, and the site will work normally either way.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-sm uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-sage">Children</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-body md:text-base">
        This site is intended for adults. I do not knowingly collect information from children.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-sm uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-sage">Questions or requests</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-body md:text-base">
        If you want to know what I have, or want it deleted, email me at alison@healthgardenadvocacy.com and I will take care of it.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-10 border-l-2 border-bronze pl-5 text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-slate-body">
        If this page ever changes, the date at the top will change with it.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
